        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: District heat, at consumer, waste from municipal waste incineration
Inventory is valid for the district heat based on heat waste incineration only. Heat loss is 11% while heat transportation. Heat from waste incineration ist considered to be burden-free.;
UUID: 44c06df9-31b2-3696-b9db-a1bd2dfda28d
Included is the infrastructure of the deliverysystem for district heat, the losses and the heat from waste incineration.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: Average technology
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_44c06df9-31b2-3696-b9db-a1bd2dfda28d.xml</text>
